{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "d504bfa1f1d0429fb0272dea0758387ad31aa7f5da4dae49c9b445566c875fa2", "ja": "ユニットだから", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "98130e8f6bbcff1ec44be8a4110e4e3ebf60a7816fd330f25db05a36dd821f3c", "ja": "プロデューサーと杏奈は、密かに配信の練習\nをする紬を発見。恥ずかしがる紬に杏奈は、\nネトスワ支社に行った時、自分の分も怒って\nくれてありがとう、と語る。お互いにできる\n事で補い合えばいいと、奮起する二人。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0cb2d4413c3b535075ec6804f201bcc20586c32a3a0d37a963dfb7023677dde3", "ja": "（この間の配信、皆苦戦していたな……。\nでもあれは内容が悪いというよりも……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3a16aeba5d492025386e16f21e6c91ebee7d669e126cfeb0daef25e0fef3e15e", "ja": "杏奈から見て、この間の配信はどうだった？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "eff742febbf8e3318edc696d02bb128bf0c112392561de9568d83c9e859b8c8e", "ja": "んと……悪いとは、思わなかった。\nただ……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "b330bfdc9277564b825970d26959a84b902b7a92852fc05df8f5bf4ba480529d", "ja": "もっと……みんな、いつもどおり……\n普通にしてたらいいのにって……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9cac5c69336ce6fcccba4193e4594faabaaf759068c1af396249871289a1ca5c", "ja": "うん。\nそうだな、同じ感想だ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ca5f5cb45a08889d4bda3f1e95b638d29b668c7b7065ad356193852f2408d23a", "ja": "ん、んんっ……。\nこ……こんつむ～！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c8485c0e19d9e68e960df3b56976f7b123d45020fdeafc451ba7ac88c3f3b313", "ja": "？\nなんだ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "db5e6c592e77b2d22ab445396723214f9cdadf5db939a0352248f7cf06268e58", "ja": "{$P$}さん、あっち……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8b47173d30c540d924dd59278dcbf652d57b05713dc6a3fd8939e9d87823be4d", "ja": "というわけで……白石紬と申します。\n765プロでアイドルを営んでおります。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "565846a12efb65a3ec029c642896e1d56b90d6ec54a78a73c07cb8be7623f909", "ja": "今はアイドルも、自ら情報発信をする時代。\n遅ればせながら私も、挑戦してみます。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8be219f37aba0ab26421fb1a4a16b78d91def553bc874c0b6876a559dad7e8a1", "ja": "い、いぇいっ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "353cf3db95792a3c7c1c5d77fec374f309fb1bc57864acbae1d28f7099415bac", "ja": "……ふぅ。\nええんやろか？　こんなんで……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "caa69893415f227185723d20cbfa84bb74977cefeecdfc6f8c172ceb6af0dc41", "ja": "……もう、終わった、の？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "168ff4306ab54473767aecf56ce3c1e787642db8bc699250b07d5379e4a3bf84", "ja": "ひゃっ！？　も、望月さん！\nそれに、{$P$}まで！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bfc9578a6f15d53b36270a06ee2198c52fe3a6d5559afbb8e4055f6ef3fe996a", "ja": "い、今の、見ていたのですか？\nいつから……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "eb6814468934ccd44feb239e99798ceb0826fa33d93c1daba514037486363981", "ja": "「こんつむ～」の辺りから。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8f1470d04fc4ccf8b98d6dd40689ef54451b867177d72c5c5dfe8bae2a6cbdb6", "ja": "最初では！？　な、なぜすぐ声をかけて\nくれなかったのですか……うぅ、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6c3d4f8b16f84adafef51fe65f82d816dca96c27bc1b52a057c8b3292a5413a4", "ja": "いや、配信中に入るのはよくないかなって……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "9002454c5c2929ec5760c7bae7283e0f10f6ccf9bba492dfcc305b06b2dc2427", "ja": "アーカイブ、残ってるから……\nいつでも見られる、よ……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "41537472bdac61b188fcf3e2f51313c82c4a3922fd3da799e93e8762f3582b4f", "ja": "あ、それは確かに……。ダメ、ですね。\nそんなことさえ意識できていないなんて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ec1ace1c2c05598dc79ff25c9968f6454c086584e29fc97d2f7a653e0700f6eb", "ja": "この分では、望月さんのように自然に配信できるのは、\nいつになることやら……はぁ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "7a147a728cc09fd6760981488a8a970d77a942a89a866eaf1620a1cbcfbd90de", "ja": "……紬、さん。この前、杏奈がいない時……\nネトスワで、怒ったって……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "33e0898f93cfa9c48c07d065ac4bc68fd3eb55f7dd1c7fa8050dde6f8e79ac2e", "ja": "えっ！？　あ、それは……はい。\n恥ずかしながら、感情が先に立ってしまって……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "cada930081aae6f2e521b967df65854de4a032bde7ca9c15600b735ced510650", "ja": "ううん……恥ずかしくない……です。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "b2d47f9d6e87306ca4b4ceb8c424b2b87de3addbda2d3b04d36b568ce6b1506a", "ja": "紬さん……{$P$}さんのこと、\n悪く言われたから……。怒ったんだよ、ね……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1702b4082dbfb3d2c283660520e541a46cdfd1495101e377aa2bba7117a61cd1", "ja": "っ！？　そ、それは……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "20fd3e4d3759925ace8c7ec13c9bd6d95ee42661b00cdce0dfb53ee4b1e99e07", "ja": "そうだな。あの時は、\n俺もすごく煽られてたから。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "679dbccfe3a12d8a0453eaf83e09b5696318a8e02b2eef125fb7dbfc47051f0b", "ja": "杏奈、は……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "93f229792973373a61812d139d2e9dbc60b4b911adb23d3543e61607ea5b5241", "ja": "杏奈だったら……多分、できなかった、です……。\nとっさにしゃべったりとか、苦手、だから……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "6951d09feab2c2992429165859ee09628e00ec8fddf3e8710e45dd0c0d99d2b0", "ja": "だから……紬さん。\nん、と……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "35c62551d825318886b5af0f02b1dc8a66762655c18434e271bf5219b2bd4d77", "ja": "杏奈の分も、怒ってくれて……ありがとう。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ef2093bc201dc055b19c027265b84e14829286b6668073c0207980e693716aca", "ja": "望月さん……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "c7d6a6d663cc02b6cc28312a3ab4f900e38efe64783936980c49ce18ed9fe887", "ja": "杏奈に、できないこと……してくれた、から……。\n紬さんに、できないこと……杏奈も、する……よ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "f177731d0757ee0a704575e4f69246eff525a5c12af67aedf77b635833922a02", "ja": "ひとりで、できないこと……\nみんなと一緒なら、できる……と、思う……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "65159a4e9571cfd39726d7cc8e5815575a4219c2430674827844bbab5ee84100", "ja": "杏奈の言う通りだ。ユニットを組むのは、\n足りない所を補うため。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1037_p", "source_sha256": "424b01016fd5b240c5ff0de58169249141e8b0a9c63b3c85391b2bff27b07131", "ja": "そして、それぞれが、もっとそれぞれらしく\n魅力を発揮するためだから。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "c394fda1f50a00c49fb757fc01155f695be6c0a3069e3587a57280cf6ee5e9fe", "ja": "ん……杏奈と、未来と、可奈と……\n一緒に配信、しよ……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1039_051tmg", "source_sha256": "30929d31d660fbb023d655b67f63b3581846a6a7413443de51b8467ec55e1727", "ja": "は、はい！　ぜひ！\nご指導ご鞭撻のほど、お願いします！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "7997db44bdcd15dce82dbc24211558a07655591cf226961e17af5d733826585e", "ja": "ふふ……♪\nビビッと……おまかせ、です。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "f329abc6f9bb79d34d8e2d54ac2b61956f3464d8b14caff0d6664b1a0ae9dcaf", "ja": "（紬の責任感を杏奈がうまく溶かしてくれたな……。\n一丸となった765プロ、ここからが本領発揮だ！）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
